{"type":"app","meta":{"headers":{"x-nextjs-stale-time":"300","x-nextjs-prerender":"1","x-next-cache-tags":"_N_T_/layout,_N_T_/manual/layout,_N_T_/manual/page,_N_T_/manual"}},"html":"<!DOCTYPE html><!--2DJ2zhzL_dHSrK5QsdDKA--><html lang=\"zh-TW\" data-density=\"comfortable\" data-font-size=\"standard\" class=\"__variable_07e1b6 __variable_cc7473 h-full antialiased\"><head><meta charSet=\"utf-8\"/><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"/><link rel=\"preload\" href=\"/_next/static/media/3d26d2f3aa81a833-s.p.woff2\" as=\"font\" crossorigin=\"\" type=\"font/woff2\"/><link rel=\"preload\" href=\"/_next/static/media/604a121a6fa1a135-s.p.woff2\" as=\"font\" crossorigin=\"\" type=\"font/woff2\"/><link rel=\"preload\" href=\"/_next/static/media/6e1768769e6f59a2-s.p.woff2\" as=\"font\" crossorigin=\"\" type=\"font/woff2\"/><link rel=\"preload\" href=\"/_next/static/media/ab2e3a11646b0499-s.p.woff2\" as=\"font\" crossorigin=\"\" type=\"font/woff2\"/><link rel=\"preload\" as=\"image\" href=\"/brand/tradeboss-logo.png\"/><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_next/static/css/75c047ba52e43fcc.css\" data-precedence=\"next\"/><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_next/static/css/aa90c9a426448e43.css\" data-precedence=\"next\"/><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_next/static/css/e55779c04dd245e2.css\" data-precedence=\"next\"/><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_next/static/css/8c57d5c3b938342e.css\" data-precedence=\"next\"/><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_next/static/css/4c932179cb6a336b.css\" data-precedence=\"next\"/><link rel=\"preload\" as=\"script\" fetchPriority=\"low\" href=\"/_next/static/chunks/webpack-1cf2182201f6bdb6.js\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/4bd1b696-100b9d70ed4e49c1.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/1255-ab54a41c275880be.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/main-app-acf4587a940f1946.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/2619-04bc32f026a0d946.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/app/layout-4382c12d510386d3.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/app/manual/page-d52b5074c6cdd6ee.js\" async=\"\"></script><meta name=\"next-size-adjust\" content=\"\"/><title>股市大佬 完整使用手冊 | 股市大佬 TradeBoss</title><meta name=\"description\" content=\"從註冊、每日看盤、個股研究、練功房到手機安裝，一次整理。 第一次使用建議依順序閱讀，之後可直接跳到需要的段落。\"/><link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/favicon.ico\" type=\"image/x-icon\" sizes=\"16x16\"/><script>(function(){try{var t=localStorage.getItem('obsidian-theme');if(t!=='light'&&t!=='dark')t='dark';document.documentElement.setAttribute('data-theme',t);document.documentElement.style.colorScheme=(t==='light'?'light':'dark');}catch(e){document.documentElement.setAttribute('data-theme','dark');}})();(function(){try{if(localStorage.getItem('obsidian-comfort-read')==='1')document.documentElement.classList.add('comfort-read');}catch(e){}})();(function(){try{var s=localStorage.getItem('obsidian-updown');if(s==='us')document.documentElement.setAttribute('data-updown','us');}catch(e){}})();(function(){try{var prefs=JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem('bs-preferences-v1')||'{}');var root=document.documentElement;prefs=prefs&&typeof prefs==='object'?prefs:{};root.setAttribute('data-font-size',['standard','large','xlarge','huge'].indexOf(prefs.fontSize)>=0?prefs.fontSize:'standard');root.setAttribute('data-density',prefs.density==='compact'?'compact':'comfortable');}catch(e){}})();</script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/polyfills-42372ed130431b0a.js\" noModule=\"\"></script></head><body class=\"min-h-screen bg-background text-foreground selection:bg-cyan/30 review-mode pb-40 lg:pb-16\" data-review-theme=\"dark\"><div hidden=\"\"><!--$--><!--/$--></div><a href=\"#main-content\" class=\"skip-link fixed left-3 top-3 z-[80] -translate-y-24 rounded-xl bg-accent px-4 py-2 font-black text-bg shadow-lg transition focus:translate-y-0\">跳到主要內容</a><div class=\"compliance-bar border-b border-line/40 bg-bg/60 px-4 py-1 text-center text-[10.5px] leading-tight text-muted/70\">非證券投資顧問事業<span class=\"hidden sm:inline\">｜公開資料研究與教學，不提供個股分析意見或推介</span><span class=\"sm:hidden\">｜公開資料研究與教學</span> <a class=\"underline underline-offset-2\" href=\"/legal\">法遵</a> · <a class=\"underline underline-offset-2\" href=\"/privacy\">隱私</a></div><header class=\"Navigation_header__9xJIy\"><div class=\"Navigation_inner__HaQCh\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"Navigation_backBtn__rNB5u\" aria-label=\"返回上一頁\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 256 256\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M228,128a12,12,0,0,1-12,12H69l51.52,51.51a12,12,0,0,1-17,17l-72-72a12,12,0,0,1,0-17l72-72a12,12,0,0,1,17,17L69,116H216A12,12,0,0,1,228,128Z\"></path></svg></button><a class=\"Navigation_brand__V_MfK\" aria-label=\"回股市大佬首頁\" href=\"/\"><img src=\"/brand/tradeboss-logo.png\" alt=\"股市大佬 TradeBoss\" class=\"Navigation_logoImg___eeKZ\"/><span class=\"Navigation_brandText__c1Rib\"><span class=\"Navigation_brandTitle__V8fwH\">股市<span class=\"Navigation_brandAccent__bb15A\">大佬</span></span><span class=\"Navigation_brandSub__XUkO_\">TRADEBOSS</span></span></a><nav class=\"Navigation_nav__D1U__\"><a class=\"Navigation_navLink__lvNUe\" href=\"/learn\">文章</a><a class=\"Navigation_navLink__lvNUe\" href=\"/school\">學堂</a><a class=\"Navigation_navLink__lvNUe\" href=\"/about\">關於</a><a class=\"Navigation_navLink__lvNUe\" href=\"/login\">登入</a></nav><div class=\"Navigation_actions__QSJSs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"Navigation_themeBtn__I9ble\" aria-pressed=\"false\" title=\"切換到淺色（較亮、較清楚）\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"Navigation_themeGlyph__wvU6O\">☀</span><span class=\"Navigation_srOnly__lixg9\">切換淺色</span></button><a class=\"Navigation_loginMobile__J3HwV\" href=\"/login\">登入</a></div></div></header><main id=\"main-content\" class=\"w-full\"><div class=\"StaticPage_page__Pk04n\"><nav aria-label=\"相關功能切換\" class=\"StaticPage_subNav__46on3\"><div class=\"StaticPage_subNavTrack__6PS6N\"><a class=\"StaticPage_pill__P5Z75 \" href=\"/learn\">文章</a><a class=\"StaticPage_pill__P5Z75 \" href=\"/school\">學堂</a><a class=\"StaticPage_pill__P5Z75 \" href=\"/sim\">練功房</a><a class=\"StaticPage_pill__P5Z75 \" href=\"/diary\">猜K線</a><a class=\"StaticPage_pill__P5Z75 \" href=\"/diary\">新手</a><a class=\"StaticPage_pill__P5Z75 StaticPage_pillActive__LSFUD\" aria-current=\"page\" href=\"/diary\">手冊</a></div></nav><div class=\"StaticPage_enter__wb_uk\"><section class=\"StaticPage_hero__awFjR\"><p class=\"StaticPage_heroEyebrow___LUoy\">01</p><h1 class=\"StaticPage_heroTitle__5tyIo\">股市大佬 完整使用手冊</h1><p class=\"StaticPage_heroLead__TNPFm\">從註冊、每日看盤、個股研究、練功房到手機安裝，一次整理。 第一次使用建議依順序閱讀，之後可直接跳到需要的段落。</p><nav class=\"StaticPage_heroNav__RctEV\"><a class=\"StaticPage_heroNavLink__MaVJF\" href=\"#start\">01註冊、登入與通知設定</a><a class=\"StaticPage_heroNavLink__MaVJF\" href=\"#daily\">02每天最簡單的使用流程</a><a class=\"StaticPage_heroNavLink__MaVJF\" href=\"#market\">03戰情與日報怎麼看</a><a class=\"StaticPage_heroNavLink__MaVJF\" href=\"#screeners\">04選股工具完整說明</a><a class=\"StaticPage_heroNavLink__MaVJF\" href=\"#stock\">05研究一檔股票的正確順序</a><a class=\"StaticPage_heroNavLink__MaVJF\" href=\"#research\">06AI、回測與學習工具</a><a class=\"StaticPage_heroNavLink__MaVJF\" href=\"#dojo\">07練功房與 AI 教練</a><a class=\"StaticPage_heroNavLink__MaVJF\" href=\"#community\">08社群、會員中心與回饋</a><a class=\"StaticPage_heroNavLink__MaVJF\" href=\"#app\">09網站捷徑與原生 App</a><a class=\"StaticPage_heroNavLink__MaVJF\" href=\"#rules\">10資料時效、法遵與快速檢查</a></nav></section><section id=\"start\" class=\"StaticPage_section__RXq8Q\"><div class=\"StaticPage_sectionHeader__NU9WR\"><div class=\"StaticPage_sectionHeaderRow__2r4ts\"><div class=\"StaticPage_sectionHeaderLeft__baou5\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"StaticPage_sectionMark__cRYEl\"></span><h2 class=\"StaticPage_sectionHeading__RPy_D\">註冊、登入與通知設定</h2></div></div></div><div class=\"StaticPage_sectionBody__jimzB\"><p class=\"StaticPage_pBody__SpzFp\">先把帳號與通知接好，之後換手機或加到主畫面都能繼續使用。</p><h3 class=\"StaticPage_h3___ulXG\">註冊前先準備</h3><ol class=\"StaticPage_listOrdered__RVh2D\"><li class=\"StaticPage_listItem__vaPGU\"><span class=\"StaticPage_numBadge__v_LoW\">1</span><span class=\"StaticPage_listText__ZF2_w\">準備一個能長期使用的 Email 作為登入帳號，目前不需要購買外部訂閱。</span></li><li class=\"StaticPage_listItem__vaPGU\"><span class=\"StaticPage_numBadge__v_LoW\">2</span><span class=\"StaticPage_listText__ZF2_w\">推薦碼選填：有就填（版流號／朋友分享的碼可重複使用、不限次數）；沒有也可以直接註冊，會標成陌生客戶。</span></li><li class=\"StaticPage_listItem__vaPGU\"><span class=\"StaticPage_numBadge__v_LoW\">3</span><span class=\"StaticPage_listText__ZF2_w\">App 推播不需要 Telegram：安裝股市大佬 App、允許系統通知，再到「推播設定」選主題即可。</span></li><li class=\"StaticPage_listItem__vaPGU\"><span class=\"StaticPage_numBadge__v_LoW\">4</span><span class=\"StaticPage_listText__ZF2_w\">一般會員通知統一在 App 通知中心查看，註冊不需要綁定其他通訊軟體。</span></li></ol><h3 class=\"StaticPage_h3___ulXG\">網站註冊順序</h3><ol class=\"StaticPage_listOrdered__RVh2D\"><li class=\"StaticPage_listItem__vaPGU\"><span class=\"StaticPage_numBadge__v_LoW\">1</span><span class=\"StaticPage_listText__ZF2_w\">進入 blackstockai.com，選「註冊帳號」。有推薦碼就填，沒有按「我沒有推薦碼，直接註冊」。</span></li><li class=\"StaticPage_listItem__vaPGU\"><span class=\"StaticPage_numBadge__v_LoW\">2</span><span class=\"StaticPage_listText__ZF2_w\">填 Email、至少 6 碼密碼與顯示暱稱，再選擇基本資料即可完成註冊。</span></li><li class=\"StaticPage_listItem__vaPGU\"><span class=\"StaticPage_numBadge__v_LoW\">3</span><span class=\"StaticPage_listText__ZF2_w\">送出後帳號會自動啟用，不需要等待人工審核。若顯示 Email 或綁定編號已使用，請直接回登入頁。</span></li><li class=\"StaticPage_listItem__vaPGU\"><span class=\"StaticPage_numBadge__v_LoW\">4</span><span class=\"StaticPage_listText__ZF2_w\">本站沒有電話簡訊。所謂「驗證碼」是 Telegram 機器人訊息，不是簡訊 OTP。</span></li><li class=\"StaticPage_listItem__vaPGU\"><span class=\"StaticPage_numBadge__v_LoW\">5</span><span class=\"StaticPage_listText__ZF2_w\">連續登入失敗約 8 次會暫時鎖 15 分鐘——請先確認密碼，或等解鎖後再試，不要狂按。</span></li><li class=\"StaticPage_listItem__vaPGU\"><span class=\"StaticPage_numBadge__v_LoW\">6</span><span class=\"StaticPage_listText__ZF2_w\">目前一般會員功能免費，沒有試用到期限制，回饋為自願提供。AI 每日剩餘次數可在會員中心查看；首次使用 AI 前須確認資料用途，網路查詢可另行選擇。</span></li></ol><h3 class=\"StaticPage_h3___ulXG\">App 通知設定</h3><ol class=\"StaticPage_listOrdered__RVh2D\"><li class=\"StaticPage_listItem__vaPGU\"><span class=\"StaticPage_numBadge__v_LoW\">1</span><span class=\"StaticPage_listText__ZF2_w\">App 安裝與審核進度請看 blackstockai.com/app/；iPhone 版仍待 App Store 核准，請依安裝頁當下提供的方式使用。</span></li><li class=\"StaticPage_listItem__vaPGU\"><span class=\"StaticPage_numBadge__v_LoW\">2</span><span class=\"StaticPage_listText__ZF2_w\">Android 版仍在 Google Play 機構驗證中；目前可先把網站加入主畫面（PWA），功能與 App 相同。</span></li><li class=\"StaticPage_listItem__vaPGU\"><span class=\"StaticPage_numBadge__v_LoW\">3</span><span class=\"StaticPage_listText__ZF2_w\">App 內到「推播設定」開總開關並選主題；可先按「傳一則測試通知」確認系統權限。</span></li><li class=\"StaticPage_listItem__vaPGU\"><span class=\"StaticPage_numBadge__v_LoW\">4</span><span class=\"StaticPage_listText__ZF2_w\">請在手機系統設定中允許股市大佬通知；收件匣可查看完整內容。</span></li><li class=\"StaticPage_listItem__vaPGU\"><span class=\"StaticPage_numBadge__v_LoW\">5</span><span class=\"StaticPage_listText__ZF2_w\">突然急拉、漲幅達 8%、漲停板、突然急跌、跌幅達 8%、跌停板可以分開開關。</span></li><li class=\"StaticPage_listItem__vaPGU\"><span class=\"StaticPage_numBadge__v_LoW\">6</span><span class=\"StaticPage_listText__ZF2_w\">嫌太吵就用 /mystocks_on：個股類通知只推你自選股清單裡的股票，大盤與盤後摘要不受影響。</span></li><li class=\"StaticPage_listItem__vaPGU\"><span class=\"StaticPage_numBadge__v_LoW\">7</span><span class=\"StaticPage_listText__ZF2_w\">13:20 之後的個股通知預設不推（那時多半來不及處理）；想收尾盤那段用 /tail_alerts_on 打開。</span></li><li class=\"StaticPage_listItem__vaPGU\"><span class=\"StaticPage_numBadge__v_LoW\">8</span><span class=\"StaticPage_listText__ZF2_w\">盤中爆量通知會一併顯示當下漲跌幅，看到量的同時就知道是漲是跌。</span></li><li class=\"StaticPage_listItem__vaPGU\"><span class=\"StaticPage_numBadge__v_LoW\">9</span><span class=\"StaticPage_listText__ZF2_w\">通知主題可在 App 推播設定頁開啟或關閉。通知只是客觀事件提醒，不是買賣指令。</span></li></ol><p class=\"StaticPage_pBody__SpzFp\">注意：忘記密碼時，網站會把驗證碼傳到綁定的 Telegram。請勿把綁定編號或驗證碼交給陌生人。</p><p class=\"StaticPage_pEyebrow__Mqy08\">02</p></div></section><section id=\"daily\" class=\"StaticPage_section__RXq8Q\"><div class=\"StaticPage_sectionHeader__NU9WR\"><div class=\"StaticPage_sectionHeaderRow__2r4ts\"><div class=\"StaticPage_sectionHeaderLeft__baou5\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"StaticPage_sectionMark__cRYEl\"></span><h2 class=\"StaticPage_sectionHeading__RPy_D\">每天最簡單的使用流程</h2></div></div></div><div class=\"StaticPage_sectionBody__jimzB\"><p class=\"StaticPage_pBody__SpzFp\">不需要每頁都看。照時間走，先判斷環境，再研究標的，最後覆盤。</p><h3 class=\"StaticPage_h3___ulXG\">盤前 08:00-08:45</h3><ol class=\"StaticPage_listOrdered__RVh2D\"><li class=\"StaticPage_listItem__vaPGU\"><span class=\"StaticPage_numBadge__v_LoW\">1</span><span class=\"StaticPage_listText__ZF2_w\">先看「台股日報」：掌握前一篇覆盤、今天研究象限、每檔成立條件與作廢條件。</span></li><li class=\"StaticPage_listItem__vaPGU\"><span class=\"StaticPage_numBadge__v_LoW\">2</span><span class=\"StaticPage_listText__ZF2_w\">再看「大盤環境」：台指期、加權、櫃買、外資期貨、國際市場是否同向。</span></li><li class=\"StaticPage_listItem__vaPGU\"><span class=\"StaticPage_numBadge__v_LoW\">3</span><span class=\"StaticPage_listText__ZF2_w\">到「今日戰情」快速看市場冷熱、法人動向、新聞與今日速覽。</span></li></ol><h3 class=\"StaticPage_h3___ulXG\">盤中 09:00-13:30</h3><ol class=\"StaticPage_listOrdered__RVh2D\"><li class=\"StaticPage_listItem__vaPGU\"><span class=\"StaticPage_numBadge__v_LoW\">1</span><span class=\"StaticPage_listText__ZF2_w\">先確認日報寫的市場條件是否真的成立。條件不成立的標的就不執行，也不應事後列入績效。</span></li><li class=\"StaticPage_listItem__vaPGU\"><span class=\"StaticPage_numBadge__v_LoW\">2</span><span class=\"StaticPage_listText__ZF2_w\">用「自選股」集中追蹤少數標的，不要同時盯幾十檔。</span></li><li class=\"StaticPage_listItem__vaPGU\"><span class=\"StaticPage_numBadge__v_LoW\">3</span><span class=\"StaticPage_listText__ZF2_w\">收到 App 急動通知時，查看個股與市場脈絡，不因通知直接追價。</span></li></ol><h3 class=\"StaticPage_h3___ulXG\">盤後 13:30 之後</h3><ol class=\"StaticPage_listOrdered__RVh2D\"><li class=\"StaticPage_listItem__vaPGU\"><span class=\"StaticPage_numBadge__v_LoW\">1</span><span class=\"StaticPage_listText__ZF2_w\">用「個股盯盤」看分點、法人、大戶、日 K 與新聞是否互相支持。</span></li><li class=\"StaticPage_listItem__vaPGU\"><span class=\"StaticPage_numBadge__v_LoW\">2</span><span class=\"StaticPage_listText__ZF2_w\">到「練功房」回放真實歷史盤，練進場、停損、回補與部位控制。</span></li><li class=\"StaticPage_listItem__vaPGU\"><span class=\"StaticPage_numBadge__v_LoW\">3</span><span class=\"StaticPage_listText__ZF2_w\">把自己的操作寫進會員中心或交給 AI 教練覆盤，記錄原始計畫與實際偏差。</span></li></ol><p class=\"StaticPage_pEyebrow__Mqy08\">03</p></div></section><section id=\"market\" class=\"StaticPage_section__RXq8Q\"><div class=\"StaticPage_sectionHeader__NU9WR\"><div class=\"StaticPage_sectionHeaderRow__2r4ts\"><div class=\"StaticPage_sectionHeaderLeft__baou5\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"StaticPage_sectionMark__cRYEl\"></span><h2 class=\"StaticPage_sectionHeading__RPy_D\">戰情與日報怎麼看</h2></div></div></div><div class=\"StaticPage_sectionBody__jimzB\"><p class=\"StaticPage_pBody__SpzFp\">這一區回答兩件事：今天的大環境適合什麼研究情境？昨天的推演有沒有按條件發生？</p><h3 class=\"StaticPage_h3___ulXG\">今日戰情</h3><ol class=\"StaticPage_listOrdered__RVh2D\"><li class=\"StaticPage_listItem__vaPGU\"><span class=\"StaticPage_numBadge__v_LoW\">1</span><span class=\"StaticPage_listText__ZF2_w\">市場冷熱看上漲與下跌家數，不只看加權指數漲跌。</span></li><li class=\"StaticPage_listItem__vaPGU\"><span class=\"StaticPage_numBadge__v_LoW\">2</span><span class=\"StaticPage_listText__ZF2_w\">上漲／下跌家數是跟「昨天收盤」比（除權息當天用參考價），不是跟今天開盤比。</span></li><li class=\"StaticPage_listItem__vaPGU\"><span class=\"StaticPage_numBadge__v_LoW\">3</span><span class=\"StaticPage_listText__ZF2_w\">在「大盤環境」頁點那兩個數字，可以就地展開當天是哪些股票在漲或在跌。</span></li><li class=\"StaticPage_listItem__vaPGU\"><span class=\"StaticPage_numBadge__v_LoW\">4</span><span class=\"StaticPage_listText__ZF2_w\">法人與新聞區用來理解資金背景，不代表單一個股一定跟著走。</span></li><li class=\"StaticPage_listItem__vaPGU\"><span class=\"StaticPage_numBadge__v_LoW\">5</span><span class=\"StaticPage_listText__ZF2_w\">首頁的加權指數與台指期日夜盤，可快速確認開盤前後方向是否改變。</span></li></ol><h3 class=\"StaticPage_h3___ulXG\">台股日報</h3><ol class=\"StaticPage_listOrdered__RVh2D\"><li class=\"StaticPage_listItem__vaPGU\"><span class=\"StaticPage_numBadge__v_LoW\">1</span><span class=\"StaticPage_listText__ZF2_w\">偏多強勢、偏多承接、偏空轉弱、偏空反彈無力、雙向高風險，各自有不同成立條件。</span></li><li class=\"StaticPage_listItem__vaPGU\"><span class=\"StaticPage_numBadge__v_LoW\">2</span><span class=\"StaticPage_listText__ZF2_w\">先讀大盤條件，再讀個股數據。沒有符合執行條件，就只觀察。</span></li><li class=\"StaticPage_listItem__vaPGU\"><span class=\"StaticPage_numBadge__v_LoW\">3</span><span class=\"StaticPage_listText__ZF2_w\">隔日覆盤只統計條件成立的標的，條件未成立或資料無法驗證者會排除。</span></li></ol><h3 class=\"StaticPage_h3___ulXG\">大盤環境與族群熱圖</h3><ol class=\"StaticPage_listOrdered__RVh2D\"><li class=\"StaticPage_listItem__vaPGU\"><span class=\"StaticPage_numBadge__v_LoW\">1</span><span class=\"StaticPage_listText__ZF2_w\">大盤環境整合台指期、基差、外資期貨、融資維持率、VIX 與國際市場。</span></li><li class=\"StaticPage_listItem__vaPGU\"><span class=\"StaticPage_numBadge__v_LoW\">2</span><span class=\"StaticPage_listText__ZF2_w\">族群熱圖看資金集中在哪些產業。單一個股強，但同族群全面轉弱時要提高警覺。</span></li></ol><p class=\"StaticPage_pEyebrow__Mqy08\">04</p></div></section><section id=\"screeners\" class=\"StaticPage_section__RXq8Q\"><div class=\"StaticPage_sectionHeader__NU9WR\"><div class=\"StaticPage_sectionHeaderRow__2r4ts\"><div class=\"StaticPage_sectionHeaderLeft__baou5\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"StaticPage_sectionMark__cRYEl\"></span><h2 class=\"StaticPage_sectionHeading__RPy_D\">選股工具完整說明</h2></div></div></div><div class=\"StaticPage_sectionBody__jimzB\"><p class=\"StaticPage_pBody__SpzFp\">導覽「選股」分成三段：當沖（當天買賣）、波段／存股（抱幾天以上）、進階工具。先想清楚自己要哪一種，再挑對應榜單。每個榜單只是研究入口，最終都要回到市場環境、流動性與作廢條件。</p><h3 class=\"StaticPage_h3___ulXG\">短線與隔日研究</h3><ol class=\"StaticPage_listOrdered__RVh2D\"><li class=\"StaticPage_listItem__vaPGU\"><span class=\"StaticPage_numBadge__v_LoW\">1</span><span class=\"StaticPage_listText__ZF2_w\">「量價觀察」整理成交量、量比、集中度與流動性，只呈現客觀資料。</span></li><li class=\"StaticPage_listItem__vaPGU\"><span class=\"StaticPage_numBadge__v_LoW\">2</span><span class=\"StaticPage_listText__ZF2_w\">「隔日沖研究」統計特定分點買超後的次日反向賣超歷史樣本符合率、樣本數與集中度。</span></li><li class=\"StaticPage_listItem__vaPGU\"><span class=\"StaticPage_numBadge__v_LoW\">3</span><span class=\"StaticPage_listText__ZF2_w\">「今天發生什麼事」整理漲跌幅達 8%、漲跌停、處置解禁、鉅額交易、消息與期權等客觀事件。</span></li></ol><h3 class=\"StaticPage_h3___ulXG\">籌碼與波段研究</h3><ol class=\"StaticPage_listOrdered__RVh2D\"><li class=\"StaticPage_listItem__vaPGU\"><span class=\"StaticPage_numBadge__v_LoW\">1</span><span class=\"StaticPage_listText__ZF2_w\">「資券·借券」看融資、融券、借券餘額、券資比與八大行庫。借券增量占成交量可衡量空方規模。</span></li><li class=\"StaticPage_listItem__vaPGU\"><span class=\"StaticPage_numBadge__v_LoW\">2</span><span class=\"StaticPage_listText__ZF2_w\">「波段·大戶籌碼」比較每週大戶持股比例，觀察連續沉澱或出貨，適合數週尺度。</span></li><li class=\"StaticPage_listItem__vaPGU\"><span class=\"StaticPage_numBadge__v_LoW\">3</span><span class=\"StaticPage_listText__ZF2_w\">「可轉債套利」看轉換溢價與相關資料；「除權息」看行事曆與填息研究。</span></li></ol><h3 class=\"StaticPage_h3___ulXG\">技術與自訂條件</h3><ol class=\"StaticPage_listOrdered__RVh2D\"><li class=\"StaticPage_listItem__vaPGU\"><span class=\"StaticPage_numBadge__v_LoW\">1</span><span class=\"StaticPage_listText__ZF2_w\">「K 線型態掃描」分類 W 底、頭肩底、M 頭與假突破；回到個股日 K 自行核對前高、前低與是否已過度延伸。</span></li><li class=\"StaticPage_listItem__vaPGU\"><span class=\"StaticPage_numBadge__v_LoW\">2</span><span class=\"StaticPage_listText__ZF2_w\">「歷史籌碼條件」可依均線、量價、法人等欄位縮小名單。條件越多不一定越好，先確認資料日與樣本數。</span></li><li class=\"StaticPage_listItem__vaPGU\"><span class=\"StaticPage_numBadge__v_LoW\">3</span><span class=\"StaticPage_listText__ZF2_w\">「地雷·處置股」整理警示與處置風險，避免在不知道交易限制的情況下進場。</span></li></ol><h3 class=\"StaticPage_h3___ulXG\">研究工具箱（掃描 · 比較 · 估值）</h3><ol class=\"StaticPage_listOrdered__RVh2D\"><li class=\"StaticPage_listItem__vaPGU\"><span class=\"StaticPage_numBadge__v_LoW\">1</span><span class=\"StaticPage_listText__ZF2_w\">「條件掃描」把技術與籌碼條件做交集／聯集排行，命中的組合可存起來下次直接套用。</span></li><li class=\"StaticPage_listItem__vaPGU\"><span class=\"StaticPage_numBadge__v_LoW\">2</span><span class=\"StaticPage_listText__ZF2_w\">「多股比較」把 2～5 檔的走勢與基本面並排，快速看誰相對強弱，不必逐頁切換。</span></li><li class=\"StaticPage_listItem__vaPGU\"><span class=\"StaticPage_numBadge__v_LoW\">3</span><span class=\"StaticPage_listText__ZF2_w\">「估值情境器」自己填預估 EPS 與本益倍數，換算出研究用價格區間——是假設演練，不是目標價。</span></li></ol><p class=\"StaticPage_pEyebrow__Mqy08\">05</p></div></section><section id=\"stock\" class=\"StaticPage_section__RXq8Q\"><div class=\"StaticPage_sectionHeader__NU9WR\"><div class=\"StaticPage_sectionHeaderRow__2r4ts\"><div class=\"StaticPage_sectionHeaderLeft__baou5\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"StaticPage_sectionMark__cRYEl\"></span><h2 class=\"StaticPage_sectionHeading__RPy_D\">研究一檔股票的正確順序</h2></div></div></div><div class=\"StaticPage_sectionBody__jimzB\"><p class=\"StaticPage_pBody__SpzFp\">不要只看一顆燈或一個分點。用固定順序，避免只挑自己想看的證據。</p><h3 class=\"StaticPage_h3___ulXG\">個股盯盤</h3><ol class=\"StaticPage_listOrdered__RVh2D\"><li class=\"StaticPage_listItem__vaPGU\"><span class=\"StaticPage_numBadge__v_LoW\">1</span><span class=\"StaticPage_listText__ZF2_w\">先確認代號、名稱、資料日期與即時價格，再看走勢 K 線的開高低收。</span></li><li class=\"StaticPage_listItem__vaPGU\"><span class=\"StaticPage_numBadge__v_LoW\">2</span><span class=\"StaticPage_listText__ZF2_w\">走勢 K 線可切日 K／5 分／1 分：日 K 可開均線、MACD、RSI；分 K 由逐筆聚合，熱門股較完整。</span></li><li class=\"StaticPage_listItem__vaPGU\"><span class=\"StaticPage_numBadge__v_LoW\">3</span><span class=\"StaticPage_listText__ZF2_w\">往下看「本益比河流」對照現在估值在歷史的相對高低；再依序看法人、主要分點、大戶籌碼、新聞與研究摘要（含證據檢查清單）。</span></li><li class=\"StaticPage_listItem__vaPGU\"><span class=\"StaticPage_numBadge__v_LoW\">4</span><span class=\"StaticPage_listText__ZF2_w\">主力買超不等於隔日上漲。要同時看它是波段進貨、短沖倒貨，還是單日事件。</span></li></ol><h3 class=\"StaticPage_h3___ulXG\">技術分析</h3><ol class=\"StaticPage_listOrdered__RVh2D\"><li class=\"StaticPage_listItem__vaPGU\"><span class=\"StaticPage_numBadge__v_LoW\">1</span><span class=\"StaticPage_listText__ZF2_w\">日 K 結構呈現資料日收盤、均線、RSI、量比、乖離與 20 日位階。</span></li><li class=\"StaticPage_listItem__vaPGU\"><span class=\"StaticPage_numBadge__v_LoW\">2</span><span class=\"StaticPage_listText__ZF2_w\">會員版不自動提供延伸價位；指標高低只描述歷史資料，不推估下一次走勢。</span></li><li class=\"StaticPage_listItem__vaPGU\"><span class=\"StaticPage_numBadge__v_LoW\">3</span><span class=\"StaticPage_listText__ZF2_w\">一般會員版不提供 5 分 K 盤中判讀、方向或平台進出指令，也不預測下一根 K 棒。</span></li><li class=\"StaticPage_listItem__vaPGU\"><span class=\"StaticPage_numBadge__v_LoW\">4</span><span class=\"StaticPage_listText__ZF2_w\">請核對資料日：今天收盤和分點／法人常常不是同一天。</span></li></ol><h3 class=\"StaticPage_h3___ulXG\">分點排行、分點名冊與自選股</h3><ol class=\"StaticPage_listOrdered__RVh2D\"><li class=\"StaticPage_listItem__vaPGU\"><span class=\"StaticPage_numBadge__v_LoW\">1</span><span class=\"StaticPage_listText__ZF2_w\">分點排行用來找全市場買賣超較大的券商據點。</span></li><li class=\"StaticPage_listItem__vaPGU\"><span class=\"StaticPage_numBadge__v_LoW\">2</span><span class=\"StaticPage_listText__ZF2_w\">分點名冊整理常見分點的歷史手法與樣本，不等于單一主力，也不用靠印象貼標籤。</span></li><li class=\"StaticPage_listItem__vaPGU\"><span class=\"StaticPage_numBadge__v_LoW\">3</span><span class=\"StaticPage_listText__ZF2_w\">研究完可加入自選股，並依區間漲跌、近 5／20 日報酬排序，一頁掃過清單。</span></li><li class=\"StaticPage_listItem__vaPGU\"><span class=\"StaticPage_numBadge__v_LoW\">4</span><span class=\"StaticPage_listText__ZF2_w\">「到價提醒」可設到價、爆量、接近支撐壓力、均線與波動條件；外資連買已停用（法人是盤後才公布）。盤中急拉急跌主題在「戰情室警報」。</span></li></ol><p class=\"StaticPage_pEyebrow__Mqy08\">06</p></div></section><section id=\"research\" class=\"StaticPage_section__RXq8Q\"><div class=\"StaticPage_sectionHeader__NU9WR\"><div class=\"StaticPage_sectionHeaderRow__2r4ts\"><div class=\"StaticPage_sectionHeaderLeft__baou5\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"StaticPage_sectionMark__cRYEl\"></span><h2 class=\"StaticPage_sectionHeading__RPy_D\">AI、回測與學習工具</h2></div></div></div><div class=\"StaticPage_sectionBody__jimzB\"><p class=\"StaticPage_pBody__SpzFp\">AI 用來整理、解釋與檢討，不代替你承擔風險，也不應製造不存在的數據。</p><h3 class=\"StaticPage_h3___ulXG\">問 AI（含條件整理）</h3><ol class=\"StaticPage_listOrdered__RVh2D\"><li class=\"StaticPage_listItem__vaPGU\"><span class=\"StaticPage_numBadge__v_LoW\">1</span><span class=\"StaticPage_listText__ZF2_w\">可輸入「分析 2330」「券資比是什麼」「這張 K 線圖怎麼看」等明確問題。</span></li><li class=\"StaticPage_listItem__vaPGU\"><span class=\"StaticPage_numBadge__v_LoW\">2</span><span class=\"StaticPage_listText__ZF2_w\">創新高可以問「目前有哪些已發生的量價變化」；AI 不報延伸價位，也不以觀察帶代稱買賣指令。</span></li><li class=\"StaticPage_listItem__vaPGU\"><span class=\"StaticPage_numBadge__v_LoW\">3</span><span class=\"StaticPage_listText__ZF2_w\">回答應白話短句。若出現「必須報這個數字」這類內部備註，那是系統漏了，請回饋。</span></li><li class=\"StaticPage_listItem__vaPGU\"><span class=\"StaticPage_numBadge__v_LoW\">4</span><span class=\"StaticPage_listText__ZF2_w\">「條件整理」模式：把主觀假設拆成可驗證欄位、資料日、目前值與作廢條件；不提供未來方向、機率或平台價位。</span></li><li class=\"StaticPage_listItem__vaPGU\"><span class=\"StaticPage_numBadge__v_LoW\">5</span><span class=\"StaticPage_listText__ZF2_w\">「新聞解讀」模式：整理消息敘事、影響對象與新舊程度，只引用站內實際新聞，不外推股價方向。</span></li><li class=\"StaticPage_listItem__vaPGU\"><span class=\"StaticPage_numBadge__v_LoW\">6</span><span class=\"StaticPage_listText__ZF2_w\">可上傳 K 線截圖或自己的對帳單。對帳單只用來檢討本人過去操作，不提供代操。</span></li><li class=\"StaticPage_listItem__vaPGU\"><span class=\"StaticPage_numBadge__v_LoW\">7</span><span class=\"StaticPage_listText__ZF2_w\">每次回答都應以站內客觀資料、歷史統計與作廢條件為主。若資料日期不明，先要求 AI 說明。</span></li></ol><h3 class=\"StaticPage_h3___ulXG\">分點操盤驗證</h3><ol class=\"StaticPage_listOrdered__RVh2D\"><li class=\"StaticPage_listItem__vaPGU\"><span class=\"StaticPage_numBadge__v_LoW\">1</span><span class=\"StaticPage_listText__ZF2_w\">查看特定主力玩法過去的樣本數、歷史樣本符合率與報酬分布。</span></li><li class=\"StaticPage_listItem__vaPGU\"><span class=\"StaticPage_numBadge__v_LoW\">2</span><span class=\"StaticPage_listText__ZF2_w\">樣本少於 5 次時參考價值很低。歷史樣本符合率高也要核對平均損益與交易成本。</span></li><li class=\"StaticPage_listItem__vaPGU\"><span class=\"StaticPage_numBadge__v_LoW\">3</span><span class=\"StaticPage_listText__ZF2_w\">歷史回測會失效，應比較不同市場環境，不能把單一期間當保證。</span></li></ol><h3 class=\"StaticPage_h3___ulXG\">台股學堂與玩法總覽</h3><ol class=\"StaticPage_listOrdered__RVh2D\"><li class=\"StaticPage_listItem__vaPGU\"><span class=\"StaticPage_numBadge__v_LoW\">1</span><span class=\"StaticPage_listText__ZF2_w\">台股學堂用白話解釋分點、集中度、量比、資券、大戶、型態、停損與鎖停風險。</span></li><li class=\"StaticPage_listItem__vaPGU\"><span class=\"StaticPage_numBadge__v_LoW\">2</span><span class=\"StaticPage_listText__ZF2_w\">玩法總覽依新手、短線、波段、消息與事件研究分類，協助理解不同資料口徑與風險。</span></li></ol><p class=\"StaticPage_pEyebrow__Mqy08\">07</p></div></section><section id=\"dojo\" class=\"StaticPage_section__RXq8Q\"><div class=\"StaticPage_sectionHeader__NU9WR\"><div class=\"StaticPage_sectionHeaderRow__2r4ts\"><div class=\"StaticPage_sectionHeaderLeft__baou5\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"StaticPage_sectionMark__cRYEl\"></span><h2 class=\"StaticPage_sectionHeading__RPy_D\">練功房與 AI 教練</h2></div></div></div><div class=\"StaticPage_sectionBody__jimzB\"><p class=\"StaticPage_pBody__SpzFp\">先在歷史盤練流程，再把真實資金放進市場。練習重點是執行，不是事後挑最好位置。</p><h3 class=\"StaticPage_h3___ulXG\">開始一場回放</h3><ol class=\"StaticPage_listOrdered__RVh2D\"><li class=\"StaticPage_listItem__vaPGU\"><span class=\"StaticPage_numBadge__v_LoW\">1</span><span class=\"StaticPage_listText__ZF2_w\">選擇有錄製資料的日期與股票，從開盤前開始播放，避免先看到結局。</span></li><li class=\"StaticPage_listItem__vaPGU\"><span class=\"StaticPage_numBadge__v_LoW\">2</span><span class=\"StaticPage_listText__ZF2_w\">可切換 1 分 K、5 分 K 與 0.1 倍到 10 倍速度，五檔與逐筆會跟著歷史時間前進。</span></li><li class=\"StaticPage_listItem__vaPGU\"><span class=\"StaticPage_numBadge__v_LoW\">3</span><span class=\"StaticPage_listText__ZF2_w\">股票模擬會估算手續費 1 折與當沖證交稅；台指期使用每點 200 元、每口單邊 50 元的教學估算。代號 TXF 是台指期近月。實際費率以券商為準。</span></li></ol><h3 class=\"StaticPage_h3___ulXG\">委託與成交</h3><ol class=\"StaticPage_listOrdered__RVh2D\"><li class=\"StaticPage_listItem__vaPGU\"><span class=\"StaticPage_numBadge__v_LoW\">1</span><span class=\"StaticPage_listText__ZF2_w\">市價、限價與 MIT 觸價單要分清楚。限價單只有在歷史行情真的碰到價格時才成交。</span></li><li class=\"StaticPage_listItem__vaPGU\"><span class=\"StaticPage_numBadge__v_LoW\">2</span><span class=\"StaticPage_listText__ZF2_w\">時間往回拉時，部位、成交與損益會跟著事件倒帶，不能用未來價格成交。</span></li><li class=\"StaticPage_listItem__vaPGU\"><span class=\"StaticPage_numBadge__v_LoW\">3</span><span class=\"StaticPage_listText__ZF2_w\">每次進場前先寫方向、原因、作廢點與預計部位，結束後再和實際執行比較。</span></li></ol><h3 class=\"StaticPage_h3___ulXG\">AI 教練覆盤</h3><ol class=\"StaticPage_listOrdered__RVh2D\"><li class=\"StaticPage_listItem__vaPGU\"><span class=\"StaticPage_numBadge__v_LoW\">1</span><span class=\"StaticPage_listText__ZF2_w\">AI 會依你的真實模擬成交、部位變化與平倉損益檢查執行。</span></li><li class=\"StaticPage_listItem__vaPGU\"><span class=\"StaticPage_numBadge__v_LoW\">2</span><span class=\"StaticPage_listText__ZF2_w\">重點包含做對的事、最需要修正的事、下一次可重複的規則。</span></li><li class=\"StaticPage_listItem__vaPGU\"><span class=\"StaticPage_numBadge__v_LoW\">3</span><span class=\"StaticPage_listText__ZF2_w\">不要只看賺賠。錯誤流程碰巧獲利，仍然是要修正的交易。</span></li></ol><p class=\"StaticPage_pEyebrow__Mqy08\">08</p></div></section><section id=\"community\" class=\"StaticPage_section__RXq8Q\"><div class=\"StaticPage_sectionHeader__NU9WR\"><div class=\"StaticPage_sectionHeaderRow__2r4ts\"><div class=\"StaticPage_sectionHeaderLeft__baou5\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"StaticPage_sectionMark__cRYEl\"></span><h2 class=\"StaticPage_sectionHeading__RPy_D\">社群、會員中心與回饋</h2></div></div></div><div class=\"StaticPage_sectionBody__jimzB\"><p class=\"StaticPage_pBody__SpzFp\">把問題留在正確位置，管理員才能追蹤，其他會員也能從公開答案受益。</p><h3 class=\"StaticPage_h3___ulXG\">社群基地</h3><ol class=\"StaticPage_listOrdered__RVh2D\"><li class=\"StaticPage_listItem__vaPGU\"><span class=\"StaticPage_numBadge__v_LoW\">1</span><span class=\"StaticPage_listText__ZF2_w\">討論區可分享盤感、學習心得與歷史操作，不報明牌、不喊目標價。</span></li><li class=\"StaticPage_listItem__vaPGU\"><span class=\"StaticPage_numBadge__v_LoW\">2</span><span class=\"StaticPage_listText__ZF2_w\">有人留言你的貼文時，可在 App 通知中心查看並開啟貼文，不需要其他通訊軟體。</span></li><li class=\"StaticPage_listItem__vaPGU\"><span class=\"StaticPage_numBadge__v_LoW\">3</span><span class=\"StaticPage_listText__ZF2_w\">AI 人設留言會接住原文具體細節；若語意不清，應提問而不是自行腦補。</span></li></ol><h3 class=\"StaticPage_h3___ulXG\">會員中心</h3><ol class=\"StaticPage_listOrdered__RVh2D\"><li class=\"StaticPage_listItem__vaPGU\"><span class=\"StaticPage_numBadge__v_LoW\">1</span><span class=\"StaticPage_listText__ZF2_w\">查看身分、每日 AI 額度、自己的推薦碼、回饋紀錄與管理員回覆。</span></li><li class=\"StaticPage_listItem__vaPGU\"><span class=\"StaticPage_numBadge__v_LoW\">2</span><span class=\"StaticPage_listText__ZF2_w\">可提交問題回報、功能建議、使用心得或交易覆盤，必要時附截圖。</span></li><li class=\"StaticPage_listItem__vaPGU\"><span class=\"StaticPage_numBadge__v_LoW\">3</span><span class=\"StaticPage_listText__ZF2_w\">勾選願意公開後，經管理員審核才會出現在公開回饋牆。</span></li></ol><h3 class=\"StaticPage_h3___ulXG\">遇到問題時提供什麼</h3><ol class=\"StaticPage_listOrdered__RVh2D\"><li class=\"StaticPage_listItem__vaPGU\"><span class=\"StaticPage_numBadge__v_LoW\">1</span><span class=\"StaticPage_listText__ZF2_w\">請附頁面名稱、操作順序、看到的錯誤文字、手機型號與系統版本。</span></li><li class=\"StaticPage_listItem__vaPGU\"><span class=\"StaticPage_numBadge__v_LoW\">2</span><span class=\"StaticPage_listText__ZF2_w\">若是資料疑問，請附股票代號、日期與欄位；若是版面問題，請附完整截圖。</span></li></ol><p class=\"StaticPage_pEyebrow__Mqy08\">09</p></div></section><section id=\"app\" class=\"StaticPage_section__RXq8Q\"><div class=\"StaticPage_sectionHeader__NU9WR\"><div class=\"StaticPage_sectionHeaderRow__2r4ts\"><div class=\"StaticPage_sectionHeaderLeft__baou5\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"StaticPage_sectionMark__cRYEl\"></span><h2 class=\"StaticPage_sectionHeading__RPy_D\">網站捷徑與原生 App</h2></div></div></div><div class=\"StaticPage_sectionBody__jimzB\"><p class=\"StaticPage_pBody__SpzFp\">加入主畫面只是網站捷徑；需要原生推播與較完整的手機整合時，請使用股市大佬 App。</p><h3 class=\"StaticPage_h3___ulXG\">iPhone / iPad</h3><ol class=\"StaticPage_listOrdered__RVh2D\"><li class=\"StaticPage_listItem__vaPGU\"><span class=\"StaticPage_numBadge__v_LoW\">1</span><span class=\"StaticPage_listText__ZF2_w\">一定要用 Safari 開啟 https://blackstockai.com。若目前在 Line、Telegram、Facebook 內建瀏覽器，先按選單並選「在 Safari 中開啟」。</span></li><li class=\"StaticPage_listItem__vaPGU\"><span class=\"StaticPage_numBadge__v_LoW\">2</span><span class=\"StaticPage_listText__ZF2_w\">點 Safari 下方或上方的分享按鈕，圖示是方框加向上箭頭。</span></li><li class=\"StaticPage_listItem__vaPGU\"><span class=\"StaticPage_numBadge__v_LoW\">3</span><span class=\"StaticPage_listText__ZF2_w\">在分享選單往下滑，點「加入主畫面」。確認名稱為「股市大佬」，再點右上角「新增」。</span></li><li class=\"StaticPage_listItem__vaPGU\"><span class=\"StaticPage_numBadge__v_LoW\">4</span><span class=\"StaticPage_listText__ZF2_w\">回到桌面點股市大佬圖示即可。這是 PWA 網站捷徑；若更新後畫面卡住，先完全關閉再開，看到修復快取按鈕可直接使用，不會清除登入。</span></li><li class=\"StaticPage_listItem__vaPGU\"><span class=\"StaticPage_numBadge__v_LoW\">5</span><span class=\"StaticPage_listText__ZF2_w\">建議 iOS 16.4 以上。iOS 16.2 等舊版本雖有相容處理，但系統瀏覽器能力仍可能受限。</span></li></ol><h3 class=\"StaticPage_h3___ulXG\">Android Chrome</h3><ol class=\"StaticPage_listOrdered__RVh2D\"><li class=\"StaticPage_listItem__vaPGU\"><span class=\"StaticPage_numBadge__v_LoW\">1</span><span class=\"StaticPage_listText__ZF2_w\">用 Chrome 開啟網站，點右上角三個點。</span></li><li class=\"StaticPage_listItem__vaPGU\"><span class=\"StaticPage_numBadge__v_LoW\">2</span><span class=\"StaticPage_listText__ZF2_w\">選「安裝應用程式」或「加到主畫面」，再按「安裝 / 新增」。不同品牌手機文字可能略有不同。</span></li><li class=\"StaticPage_listItem__vaPGU\"><span class=\"StaticPage_numBadge__v_LoW\">3</span><span class=\"StaticPage_listText__ZF2_w\">若使用 Samsung Internet，點選單後選「新增頁面至」再選「主畫面」。</span></li></ol><h3 class=\"StaticPage_h3___ulXG\">安裝後要知道</h3><ol class=\"StaticPage_listOrdered__RVh2D\"><li class=\"StaticPage_listItem__vaPGU\"><span class=\"StaticPage_numBadge__v_LoW\">1</span><span class=\"StaticPage_listText__ZF2_w\">加入主畫面不會取得原生 App 推播。要收原生通知請安裝股市大佬 App，並允許系統通知。</span></li><li class=\"StaticPage_listItem__vaPGU\"><span class=\"StaticPage_numBadge__v_LoW\">2</span><span class=\"StaticPage_listText__ZF2_w\">換手機時重新加到主畫面，再用原 Email 與密碼登入即可。</span></li><li class=\"StaticPage_listItem__vaPGU\"><span class=\"StaticPage_numBadge__v_LoW\">3</span><span class=\"StaticPage_listText__ZF2_w\">網站更新通常會自動載入。若一直看到舊版，完全關閉後再開，或用 Safari / Chrome 清除該網站快取。</span></li></ol><p class=\"StaticPage_pEyebrow__Mqy08\">10</p></div></section><section id=\"rules\" class=\"StaticPage_section__RXq8Q\"><div class=\"StaticPage_sectionHeader__NU9WR\"><div class=\"StaticPage_sectionHeaderRow__2r4ts\"><div class=\"StaticPage_sectionHeaderLeft__baou5\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"StaticPage_sectionMark__cRYEl\"></span><h2 class=\"StaticPage_sectionHeading__RPy_D\">資料時效、法遵與快速檢查</h2></div></div></div><div class=\"StaticPage_sectionBody__jimzB\"><p class=\"StaticPage_pBody__SpzFp\">使用任何功能前，先確認資料日期與用途。研究工具不是獲利承諾。</p><h3 class=\"StaticPage_h3___ulXG\">資料時效</h3><ol class=\"StaticPage_listOrdered__RVh2D\"><li class=\"StaticPage_listItem__vaPGU\"><span class=\"StaticPage_numBadge__v_LoW\">1</span><span class=\"StaticPage_listText__ZF2_w\">即時行情、盤中急動與五檔屬盤中資料；分點、法人、資券與大戶多為盤後或每週更新。</span></li><li class=\"StaticPage_listItem__vaPGU\"><span class=\"StaticPage_numBadge__v_LoW\">2</span><span class=\"StaticPage_listText__ZF2_w\">除權息日漲跌幅必須用官方參考價計算，不能拿前一日原始收盤硬比。</span></li><li class=\"StaticPage_listItem__vaPGU\"><span class=\"StaticPage_numBadge__v_LoW\">3</span><span class=\"StaticPage_listText__ZF2_w\">頁面載入失敗時不要用舊截圖代替最新資料，先確認日期或稍後重試。</span></li></ol><h3 class=\"StaticPage_h3___ulXG\">法遵紅線</h3><ol class=\"StaticPage_listOrdered__RVh2D\"><li class=\"StaticPage_listItem__vaPGU\"><span class=\"StaticPage_numBadge__v_LoW\">1</span><span class=\"StaticPage_listText__ZF2_w\">本站提供公開資料整理、歷史統計、研究情境與教育內容，不提供個股買賣指令。</span></li><li class=\"StaticPage_listItem__vaPGU\"><span class=\"StaticPage_numBadge__v_LoW\">2</span><span class=\"StaticPage_listText__ZF2_w\">不報明牌、不喊目標價、不保證獲利。量化與盤中研究訊號只限具明確研究權限的帳號。</span></li><li class=\"StaticPage_listItem__vaPGU\"><span class=\"StaticPage_numBadge__v_LoW\">3</span><span class=\"StaticPage_listText__ZF2_w\">AI 教練只檢討你自己的過去操作；任何決策都應自行判斷並承擔風險。</span></li></ol><h3 class=\"StaticPage_h3___ulXG\">新手第一週清單</h3><ol class=\"StaticPage_listOrdered__RVh2D\"><li class=\"StaticPage_listItem__vaPGU\"><span class=\"StaticPage_numBadge__v_LoW\">1</span><span class=\"StaticPage_listText__ZF2_w\">安裝 App、允許通知並開啟至少一個主題；完整內容可在通知中心查看。</span></li><li class=\"StaticPage_listItem__vaPGU\"><span class=\"StaticPage_numBadge__v_LoW\">2</span><span class=\"StaticPage_listText__ZF2_w\">每天只看台股日報、今日戰情、大盤環境三頁。</span></li><li class=\"StaticPage_listItem__vaPGU\"><span class=\"StaticPage_numBadge__v_LoW\">3</span><span class=\"StaticPage_listText__ZF2_w\">挑一檔進個股盯盤與技術分析，先核對客觀資料。</span></li><li class=\"StaticPage_listItem__vaPGU\"><span class=\"StaticPage_numBadge__v_LoW\">4</span><span class=\"StaticPage_listText__ZF2_w\">至少完成三場練功房回放，再決定自己適合當沖、隔日或波段。</span></li><li class=\"StaticPage_listItem__vaPGU\"><span class=\"StaticPage_numBadge__v_LoW\">5</span><span class=\"StaticPage_listText__ZF2_w\">遇到不懂的名詞先查台股學堂，再問 AI，最後用回饋補充網站仍缺少的說明。</span></li></ol><p class=\"StaticPage_pBody__SpzFp\">注意：完整手冊可隨時從「學習 → 使用手冊」重新開啟。</p></div></section><section class=\"StaticPage_section__RXq8Q\"><div class=\"StaticPage_sectionHeader__NU9WR\"><div class=\"StaticPage_sectionHeaderRow__2r4ts\"><div class=\"StaticPage_sectionHeaderLeft__baou5\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"StaticPage_sectionMark__cRYEl\"></span><h2 class=\"StaticPage_sectionHeading__RPy_D\">還有問題？</h2></div></div></div><div class=\"StaticPage_sectionBody__jimzB\"><p class=\"StaticPage_pBody__SpzFp\">到會員中心提交回饋，請附頁面、操作順序、錯誤文字與裝置資訊。 也可以先到玩法總覽，依自己的交易方式找到最短使用路線。</p><a class=\"StaticPage_link__I15iY\" href=\"/diary\">前往會員中心</a><a class=\"StaticPage_link__I15iY\" href=\"/diary\">查看玩法總覽</a></div></section></div></div><!--$--><!--/$--></main><footer class=\"site-footer mx-auto mt-14 w-full max-w-[1360px] px-4 md:px-6\"><div class=\"data-panel rounded-2xl border border-line/80 bg-surface/70 p-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted\"><p class=\"mb-1.5 font-bold text-ink\">免責與法遵聲明</p><p>本平台提供台股公開籌碼資料之統計、教學與研究工具，所有數字均為歷史資料整理，<span class=\"font-bold text-ink\">不構成任何投資建議、招攬、買賣要約或獲利保證</span>。平台不代客操作、不提供個股買賣訊號、不保證準確性。 投資有風險，交易前請自行評估、獨立判斷並自負盈虧。 本站不會私訊要驗證碼或叫你匯款。</p><nav aria-label=\"公司資訊與法遵\" class=\"flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-x-3 gap-y-2 text-[12.5px] font-bold mt-3\"><a class=\"min-h-11 inline-flex items-center text-accent underline-offset-2 hover:underline\" href=\"/about\">關於本站</a><a class=\"min-h-11 inline-flex items-center text-accent underline-offset-2 hover:underline\" href=\"/guide\">新手導覽</a><a class=\"min-h-11 inline-flex items-center text-accent underline-offset-2 hover:underline\" href=\"/privacy\">隱私權政策</a><a class=\"min-h-11 inline-flex items-center text-accent underline-offset-2 hover:underline\" href=\"/terms\">服務條款</a><a class=\"min-h-11 inline-flex items-center text-accent underline-offset-2 hover:underline\" href=\"/legal\">法遵說明</a><a class=\"min-h-11 inline-flex items-center text-accent underline-offset-2 hover:underline\" href=\"/member/?tab=feedback\">使用回饋／刪帳</a></nav></div><p class=\"mt-3 pb-2 text-center text-sm font-bold tracking-wide text-muted\">股市大佬 TradeBoss · © 2026 資料研究工具｜非投資建議</p></footer><nav aria-label=\"手機導覽（未登入）\" class=\"mobile-taskbar fixed inset-x-0 bottom-0 z-30 grid h-[calc(4.5rem+env(safe-area-inset-bottom))] grid-cols-5 border-t border-line bg-surface/96 pb-[env(safe-area-inset-bottom)] backdrop-blur-xl lg:hidden\"><a class=\"flex min-w-0 flex-col items-center justify-center gap-0.5 text-[11px] font-black transition active:scale-95 text-muted\" href=\"/\"><span class=\"grid place-items-center rounded-full transition-all duration-200 h-7 w-10 text-current\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 256 256\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M222.14,105.85l-80-80a20,20,0,0,0-28.28,0l-80,80A19.86,19.86,0,0,0,28,120v96a12,12,0,0,0,12,12h64a12,12,0,0,0,12-12V164h24v52a12,12,0,0,0,12,12h64a12,12,0,0,0,12-12V120A19.86,19.86,0,0,0,22